#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:9
#: a3586718f3e1483e87bc1b8f77a60e6a
msgid "Rotational Trading"
msgstr "轮动交易"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 4750b93d53534a5e87d43e721960fcbc Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"Rotational trading involves buying top-performing assets and selling "
"underperforming ones. **PyBroker** can be used for backtesting these "
"strategies."
msgstr ""
"轮动交易涉及购买表现最好的资产，同时出售表现不佳的资产。**PyBroker** 可用"
"于回测此类策略。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 4771c8c98daa454cb84acb77079f7439 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:33
msgid ""
"Our strategy will involve ranking and buying stocks with the highest "
"`price rate-of-change (ROC) <https://www.investopedia.com/terms/p/"
"pricerateofchange.asp>`__. To start, we'll define a 20-day ROC indicator "
"using `TA-Lib <https://github.com/TA-Lib/ta-lib-python>`__:"
msgstr ""
"我们的策略将涉及对 `价格涨幅（ROC） <https://www.investopedia.com/terms/p/"
"pricerateofchange.asp>`__ 最高的股票进行排名和购买。首先，我们将使用 `TA-"
"Lib <https://github.com/TA-Lib/ta-lib-python>`__ 定义一个 20 天的 ROC 指"
"标："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 8190564bcfa84edbad039658d93963c4 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:58
msgid "Next, let's define the rules of our strategy:"
msgstr "接下来，让我们定义策略的规则："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 5faabf4728094725b1e50f5c5c7c6643 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:60
msgid "Buy the two stocks with the highest 20-day ROC."
msgstr "购买 20 天涨幅（ROC）最高的两只股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 31268fb95da643d088fc11be227754d6 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:61
#, python-format
msgid "Allocate 50% of our capital to each stock."
msgstr "将我们的资本的 50% 分配给每只股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 3c861a7bd81f43979efe8db2a6c02f48 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:62
msgid ""
"If either of the stocks is no longer ranked among the top five 20-day "
"ROCs, then we will liquidate that stock."
msgstr ""
"如果其中一只股票不再位于前五名的 20 天涨幅（ROC）中，则我们将清盘该股票。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:63
#: a2a4449260b24466aca9af89c0c7679e
msgid "Trade these rules daily."
msgstr "每天交易这些规则。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:74
#: b572baea79004a3aad4ba73c2bf82f8d
msgid ""
"To implement the strategy, we write a ``rotate`` function that sets each "
"stock's `long_score <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/"
"pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score>`__ to its "
"20-day ROC. **PyBroker** then ranks the stocks by their ``long_score`` in "
"descending order."
msgstr ""
"为了实现该策略，我们编写一个 ``rotate`` 函数，将每只股票的 `long_score "
"<https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.context."
"html#pybroker.context.ExecContext.long_score>`__ 设置为其 20 天涨幅"
"（ROC）。然后 **PyBroker** 会根据 ``long_score`` 对这些股票进行降序排名。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 887c01706fc145d7bcde342219d4f681 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:96
msgid ""
"Now that we have a method for scoring stocks by their ROC, we can use the "
"`enable_rotation <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__ method to "
"turn on rotational trading."
msgstr ""
"既然我们已经有了一种根据 ROC 对股票评分的方法，就可以使用 "
"`enable_rotation <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__ 方法来启用轮"
"动交易。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:98
#: acebe59edf5347f4b5404f88daec5bfd
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We cap long positions at ``2`` with `set_max_long_positions <https://www."
"pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy."
"Strategy.set_max_long_positions>`__. Setting ``worst_rank_held`` to ``5`` "
"liquidates any currently held stock that falls outside the top five 20-"
"day ROC rankings. Otherwise, **PyBroker** buys up to the top two ranked "
"stocks, allocating 50% of the capital to each. This backtest uses a "
"universe of 10 stocks:"
msgstr ""
"我们通过 `set_max_long_positions <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy."
"set_max_long_positions>`__ 将多头仓位数量上限设置为 ``2``。将 "
"``worst_rank_held`` 设置为 ``5`` 会清盘任何跌出前五名 20 天涨幅（ROC）排名"
"之外的当前持仓股票。否则，**PyBroker** 会买入排名前两位的股票，将 50% 的资"
"金分配给每只股票。这次回测将使用由 10 只股票组成的股票池："

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:669
#: db02564d31a44f3284e5aa93606db0ce
msgid "Custom Position Sizing"
msgstr "自定义仓位配置"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. 85b1b962f7314adfb13941a0b87c54e4 Rotational
#: Trading.ipynb:671
msgid ""
"**PyBroker** will allocate our capital equally between positions by "
"default. To customize this, we can pass a ``sizer`` function to "
"`enable_rotation <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/pybroker."
"strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy.enable_rotation>`__. The "
"``sizer`` is called with a `RotationContext <https://www.pybroker.com/en/"
"latest/reference/pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context."
"RotationContext>`__ after rotation has decided which stocks to buy, "
"allowing us to override the size of each entry. The ``long_ranks`` "
"attribute contains the rank of each stock, where ``1`` is the highest "
"ranked."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，**PyBroker** 会将我们的资金平均分配到各个仓位。若要自定义此行"
"为，我们可以向 `enable_rotation <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/"
"reference/pybroker.strategy.html#pybroker.strategy.Strategy."
"enable_rotation>`__ 传入一个 ``sizer`` 函数。在轮动决定要买入哪些股票之"
"后，会使用 `RotationContext <https://www.pybroker.com/en/latest/reference/"
"pybroker.context.html#pybroker.context.RotationContext>`__ 调用 "
"``sizer``，使我们能够覆盖每笔入场的仓位规模。``long_ranks`` 属性包含每只股"
"票的排名，其中 ``1`` 表示排名最高。"

#: ../../source/notebooks/10. Rotational Trading.ipynb:674
#: bb0b3251d1ff448f97efc624960944b7
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Let's reuse our strategy, but this time allocate 70% of our capital to "
"the top-ranked stock and 30% to the second:"
msgstr ""
"让我们重用相同的策略，但这次将 70% 的资金分配给排名第一的股票，30% 分配给"
"排名第二的股票："
